        "text": "# Document Object Model (DOM)\n\nA **DOM** is a programming interface that makes a website interactive. The DOM turns elements of the HTML document (like text, images, buttons, and more) into objects that JavaScript can work with. \n\n<br/>\n\n\nThe DOM keeps all parts of the website (structure, style, and behavior) working together as one unified, dynamic system.",
